%% MUPP-084 Three kids: use the card's space
%% The three rows of a card with three kids share the height of the list.
flowchart TD
    A[Card with three kids] --> B[List fills the card's height]
    B --> C[Three equal rows, 12 px apart, R1]
    C --> D[Picture: row height less padding, at most 40 % of the width, at least 56 px, R2]
    C --> E[Name: text-3xl, shrinks to fit, R3]
    D --> F[Press a row]
    E --> F
    F --> G[The kid opens as before, R4]
